# oracle: fix filter/corotate b 3 (only the O-H bonds: the water angle clusters and the O-H pair; methane and ethane unfiltered) in a periodic 20 A box where the methane, the ethane and one water cross the x, y and z faces; lj/cut/coul/cut on the filtered outer level of run_style respa 2 4 (bonds and angles on level 1), fix nve, 6 outer steps of 2 fs
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 2.7e-14, atoms 6.4e-14.
# oracle-inputs: w214fc_clusters.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           real
atom_style      full
bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     harmonic
pair_style      lj/cut/coul/cut 8.0
read_data       w214fc_clusters.data
pair_coeff      1 1 0.066 3.5
pair_coeff      2 2 0.03 2.5
pair_coeff      3 3 0.1553 3.166
bond_coeff      1 340.0 1.09
bond_coeff      2 268.0 1.53
bond_coeff      3 450.0 0.9572
angle_coeff     1 33.0 109.5
angle_coeff     2 37.5 110.7
angle_coeff     3 55.0 104.52
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes
velocity        all create 300.0 4928 loop geom
thermo          1
thermo_style    custom step temp pe etotal ebond eangle evdwl ecoul press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
timestep        2
run_style respa 2 4 bond 1 angle 1 pair 2
fix             1 all nve
fix             cor all filter/corotate b 3
run             6
